2. **Lighthouse Performance Validation** (Required by Acceptance Criteria)
   - Created `lighthouserc.json` with LCP <2s assertion
   - Performance optimizations already implemented (lazy loading, preconnect, deferred JS)

3. **Test Data Attributes**
   - Added `data-test` attributes to templates for Percy test selectors:
     - `data-test="empty-cart"` in cart.html
     - `data-test="cart-items"` in cart.html
     - `data-test="add-to-cart"` in product.html
     - `data-test="filters"` in catalog.html
     - `data-test="checkout-form"` in checkout.html
     - `data-test="loyalty-panel"` in account.html

